@model KiraTakip.Models.Common.PagedResult<KiraTakip.Models.Dtos.ReservationListItemDto>
@using KiraTakip.Models
@using KiraTakip.Models.Common
@{
    Layout = "_KiraciLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Rezervasyonlarım";
    ViewData["UseCentralFeedback"] = true;
    var query = ViewBag.Query as TableQuery ?? new TableQuery();
    var pagination = PaginationModel.FromPaged(Model, "/Tenant/MyReservations", query.ToQueryDict());
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div>
        <div class="page-title">Rezervasyonlarım</div>
        <div class="page-subtitle">@Model.Total kayıt</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card p-0 overflow-hidden">
    <form method="get" action="/Tenant/MyReservations" class="table-toolbar">
        <input type="hidden" name="size" value="@query.Size" />
        <input type="search" name="q" value="@query.Q" class="form-control toolbar-search" placeholder="Ara: birim, taşınmaz…" />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">Ara</button>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(query.Q))
        {
            <a href="/Tenant/MyReservations?size=@query.Size" class="btn btn-secondary">Temizle</a>
        }
        <span class="pagination-info ml-auto"><strong>@Model.Total</strong> kayıt</span>
    </form>
    <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Birim</th>
                    <th>Taşınmaz</th>
                    <th>Başlangıç</th>
                    <th>Bitiş</th>
                    <th>Tutar</th>
                    <th>Durum</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @foreach (var reservation in Model.Items)
                {
                    var statusClasses = reservation.Status switch {
                        ReservationStatus.Planned => "badge-bos",
                        ReservationStatus.Completed => "badge-kirali",
                        ReservationStatus.Cancelled => "badge-gecmis",
                        ReservationStatus.TransferredToCharge => "badge-kurumsal",
                        _ => "badge-bos"
                    };
                    var statusLabel = reservation.Status switch {
                        ReservationStatus.Planned => "Planlandı",
                        ReservationStatus.Completed => "Tamamlandı",
                        ReservationStatus.Cancelled => "İptal",
                        ReservationStatus.TransferredToCharge => "Faturalandı",
                        _ => "Bilinmiyor"
                    };
                    <tr>
                        <td class="font-semibold">@reservation.UnitName</td>
                        <td class="text-sm text-muted">@reservation.PropertyName</td>
                        <td class="text-sm">@reservation.StartDate.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm")</td>
                        <td class="text-sm">@reservation.EndDate.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy HH:mm")</td>
                        <td class="text-sm font-medium">@reservation.TotalAmount.ToString("N2") ₺</td>
                        <td><span class="badge @statusClasses">@statusLabel</span></td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    @if (!Model.Items.Any())
    {
        <div class="p-8 text-center text-slate-400 font-medium">Aramaya uyan kayıt bulunamadı.</div>
    }
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_Pagination", pagination)
</div>

